A1. What the Wandering Son likes to do. ~ GAD
A4. This fish is usually caught with a can opener. ~ SARDINE
A10. This fellow must have his little joke. ~ WAG
A13. It is a sin to do this. ~ EVIL
A15. A trunk. ~ TORSO
A16. Bird frequenting the marshes of Carolina. ~ SORA
A17. This is a sign that you must reduce. ~ MINUS
A19. Part of the verb to be. ~ WAS
