A21. What a soldier wears when he joins the K. P. ~ DENIM
A23. This is hot stuff. ~ MUSTARD
A26. A barber often scrapes up an acquaintance with this. ~ RAZOR
A28. The kind of worm that always gets caught. ~ EARLY
A30. Sex appeal. ~ IT
A32. When this gets lit up it disappears. ~ TAPER
A34. A famous general. ~ LEE
A35. The worser half. ~ HE
A36. The point directly under the place where we stand. ~ NADIR
A38. Where a lot of people go to have a hot time. ~ BELOW
A40. A piece of tinware invaluable to a bride. ~ CAN
A41. A narrative poem. ~ EPIC
A42. A Grecian knockout. ~ HELEN
A43. This is how everybody appears on their birthday. ~ BARE
