A46. A church official. ~ ELDER
A47. Comparable to. ~ AS
A48. A wealthy uncle. ~ SAM
A49. This makes music when rubbed. ~ CELLO
A51. The better half. ~ MA
A52. An intrigue. ~ CABAL
A54. A sudden chill. ~ RIGOR
A56. There was a big crop of these in Kentucky (singular). ~ COLONEL
